## **5. Source Availability**

If the Software or any Derivative Work is Distributed or used to provide a Service, the Complete Corresponding Source Code must be made publicly available at no cost.

Such Source Code must correspond exactly to the version of the Software being Distributed or used.

The Source Code must be accessible through a direct and persistent means that is publicly visible and does not require payment, registration, authorization, or any other restriction.

